      "text": "🚨RESCUE - On Nov. 15, Key Largo Marine Interdiction Agents aboard a Coastal Interceptor Vessel answered a critical distress call 6nm off Key Largo. A #SCUBA diver, unconscious after a dive tank malfunction at 100’+, needed urgent help. Agents sprang into action, delivering lifesaving care, reviving the diver, and rushing them to shore for EMS transport. Swift action saved a life— this is AMO’s dedication in action! #SavingLives #Rescue",
